[32m+[m[32m#!/usr/bin/env bash[m
[32m+[m[32m# The context gauge in the composer footline, moving.[m
[32m+[m[32m#[m
[32m+[m[32m# The gauge is the eight-cell bar and the `NN% left` beside it. What moves it is[m
[32m+[m[32m# a turn: the session sets its in-flight context estimate the moment a prompt is[m
[32m+[m[32m# sent, so the reading changes on the frame Enter lands rather than when the[m
[32m+[m[32m# model answers. That is the whole reason this scene never waits for a response[m
[32m+[m[32m# and interrupts the turn -- the reading has already moved, and the model on this[m
[32m+[m[32m# network is a 1.5B on CPU that spends about a minute prefilling a prompt this[m
[32m+[m[32m# size.[m
[32m+[m[32m#[m
[32m+[m[32m# One turn, carrying a file mention sized to the server rather than to the card:[m
[32m+[m[32m#[m
[32m+[m[32m#   notes.md    20KB, about 5.8k tokens on this tokenizer. The session already[m
[32m+[m[32m#               holds roughly 25k tokens of system prompt, tools and skills, so[m
[32m+[m[32m#               the request lands near 31k -- under the 32768 the llama.cpp[m
[32m+[m[32m#               server actually serves, which is this model's training context[m
[32m+[m[32m#               and the cap llama.cpp applies whatever `-c` says. A 50KB mention[m
[32m+[m[32m#               was tried first and the server answered 400 in less than a frame,[m
[32m+[m[32m#               which drops the in-flight estimate again before any paint can[m
[32m+[m[32m#               show it: the gauge held its old reading and the recording proved[m
[32m+[m[32m#               nothing.[m
[32m+[m[32m#[m
[32m+[m[32m# The reading travels from 61% left to about 52%, which is nine points of the[m
[32m+[m[32m# number and a cell of the bar. It cannot cross a heat threshold on this server:[m
[32m+[m[32m# the hue steps at 50% USED, and 50% of the card's declared 65536 is 32768 --[m
[32m+[m[32m# exactly the prompt the server refuses.[m
[32m+[m[32m#[m
[32m+[m[32m# notes.md is written here rather than by the recorder's bootstrap, because the[m
[32m+[m[32m# bootstrap's tree is what the popup-grow scene photographs and a new file in it[m
[32m+[m[32m# would change that page's figures.[m
[32m+[m[32m#[m
[32m+[m[32m# No stills -- `import` costs about fifteen seconds a frame on this display and[m
[32m+[m[32m# would stall the middle of the motion. The page's frames are cut out of the[m
[32m+[m[32m# recording afterwards.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mhead -c 20000 /repo/packages/coding-agent/src/modes/components/status-line/component.ts >/sandbox/home/demo/notes.md[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32msettle 18[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# --- the reading travels ---------------------------------------------------[m
[32m+[m[32m# The trailing words matter: they close the mention token, so the file popup is[m
[32m+[m[32m# gone before Enter, which would otherwise accept a suggestion instead of[m
[32m+[m[32m# submitting.[m
[32m+[m[32mt "summarize @notes.md in one word"[m
[32m+[m[32mpause 1.2[m
[32m+[m[32mk Return[m
[32m+[m[32m# The reading moves here, and the prefill holds it: nothing about this wait is[m
[32m+[m[32m# waiting for the model to say anything.[m
[32m+[m[32msleep 6[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# Interrupt. Whatever the reading does next is a measurement, not a claim: the[m
[32m+[m[32m# in-flight estimate is dropped, and what is left is whatever the aborted turn[m
[32m+[m[32m# left in the history.[m
[32m+[m[32mk Escape[m
[32m+[m[32msleep 6[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# The gauge at rest, so the last frames of the take are a settled reading rather[m
[32m+[m[32m# than a travel cut off by the end of the recording.[m
[32m+[m[32msettle 4[m
